# Feature Import Boundaries

Same-feature imports only (unless noted). Full reference: `docs/architecture/import-boundaries.md`.

| Layer | May import |
|-------|------------|
| domain | own domain, `core/domains` |
| data-access | own domain, core |
| state | own domain, own data-access, core |
| ui | own domain, own ui, shared, core |
| pages | own domain, own state, own ui, shared, core |
| webmcp | own domain, own state, own webmcp, core |

## Dependency direction

```
domain ← data-access ← state ← pages / webmcp
                              ↑
                         ui (wired by pages)
```

## Do / Don't

```typescript
// ❌ UI injecting a store
@Component({ ... })
export class JobListComponent {
  private readonly store = inject(JobSearchStore);
}

// ✅ UI receives data via inputs; page wires the store
@Component({ ... })
export class JobListComponent {
  readonly jobs = input.required<JobOffer[]>();
  readonly jobSelected = output<string>();
}

// ❌ WebMCP tool injecting a repository
export function getJobTool() {
  const repo = inject(JobRepository);
}

// ✅ WebMCP tool goes through state
export function getJobTool() {
  const store = inject(JobDetailsStore);
}
```
